# CI-only Bazel settings. Loaded explicitly by the CI workflow
# (`bazel --bazelrc=.bazelrc.ci ...`); it is NOT auto-imported, so a local
# `bazel test //...` still runs every target.
#
# Skip `local_only`-tagged tests in CI. Those need the composite-capable dev
# frxlib — vmapping a hash-frx composite marker takes the CompositeOp op plus its
# batching rule, and CI runs the published wheel, which has neither. Run them
# locally against that dev frxlib. Drop this filter (and the tags) once the
# published frx pin carries the composite backport.
test --test_tag_filters=-local_only
